WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.287
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.751
<v><b>A:</b></v> Where did you go on Saturday?

00:00:05.615 --> 00:00:07.719
<v><b>B:</b></v> I went shopping for clothes.

00:00:08.611 --> 00:00:09.649
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did you buy?

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.257
<v><b>B:</b></v> I bought a new jacket.

00:00:13.124 --> 00:00:14.470
<v><b>A:</b></v> Was it expensive?

00:00:14.885 --> 00:00:16.212
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, it wasn’t.

00:00:19.243 --> 00:00:19.791
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:21.196 --> 00:00:22.937
<v><b>A:</b></v> What did you do last night?

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:27.193
<v><b>B:</b></v> I went to the cinema. I saw a new French film.

00:00:27.762 --> 00:00:28.805
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you like it?

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:34.430
<v><b>B:</b></v> No, I didn’t like it very much. It was very slow.